\ Not supported (Forth review of small-tactics-1, finding 2): an iterate
\ whose weight (its count and 2) passes tit-most (128): 99 at by-iterate.
\ Pinned Lean accepts counts up to 251 here (252: "maximum recursion
\ depth has been reached"; src/front/tactics/iterate.fs has the measures).
\ Lean: theorem u_it_deep (a b : Nat) (h : a = b) : a = b := by
\         iterate 200 skip
\         exact h
theorem u_it_deep
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  a b = explicit: h  a b =
:= by
  200 by-iterate by-skip by-end
  ' h by-exact
end u_it_deep
